      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786546413768,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The problem\n\nImagine an AI report takes 10 seconds to generate.\n\nWithout background tasks:\n\n\nUser sends request\n      ↓\nGenerate AI Report\n      ↓\nWait 10 seconds 😴\n      ↓\nUser gets response\n\n\n\n\nWith a background task:\n\n\nUser sends request\n      ↓\nStart background task ─────→ Generate report (10 sec)\n      ↓\nImmediately respond\n      ↓\n\"Report generation started!\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The problem\n\nImagine an AI report takes 10 seconds to generate.\n\nWithout background tasks:\n\n\nUser sends request\n      ↓\nGenerate AI Report\n      ↓\nWait 10 seconds 😴\n      ↓\nUser gets response\n\n\n\n\nWith a background task:\n\n\nUser sends request\n      ↓\nStart background task ─────→ Generate report (10 sec)\n      ↓\nImmediately respond\n      ↓\n\"Report generation started!\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
